---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/urls";
---
<BaseLayout title="Get Involved" description="Ways to volunteer, attend meetings and support Friends of Ashley.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Everyone is welcome" title="Small help makes a real difference." intro="Meetings are informal and open to parents, carers and staff." />
  <section class="content-section content-section--compact"><div class="site-width"><article class="vacancy-card"><p class="eyebrow">A manageable, termly role</p><h2>Could you be our next Co-Secretary?</h2><p>The Secretary role can be taken on by one person or shared between two people. The outgoing secretaries are happy to have a quick chat if you would like to know more before committing.</p><ul class="vacancy-details"><li>Agree the meeting agenda with the Co-Chairs</li><li>Send reminders and agendas in advance</li><li>Take notes and share minutes after meetings, roughly once a term</li><li>Keep FOA licences and compliance documents up to date</li><li>Help keep the shared Google Drive organised</li></ul><p class="vacancy-note">To ask about the role or arrange an informal chat with Sarah Parish and Katy Furber, email FOA.</p><div class="vacancy-actions"><a class="button button--dark" href="mailto:thefriendsofashley@gmail.com?subject=FOA%20Co-Secretary%20role&amp;body=Hi%20FOA%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20to%20ask%20about%20the%20Co-Secretary%20role.%0A%0AThanks%2C">Ask us about the role</a><a class="button button--secondary" href={withBase("/committee/")}>Meet the committee</a></div></article></div></section>
  <section class="content-section tinted-section content-section--compact"><div class="site-width"><p class="eyebrow">Volunteer teams</p><h2 class="editorial-heading">Could you help lead an event?</h2><p class="section-copy">Rachel and Sophie are leading this year's Christmas Fayre. FOA is also looking for someone to shadow Helen at Fireworks 2026 and learn how to lead the event in 2027, with no pressure.</p><div class="link-grid"><a class="info-card info-card--link" href={withBase("/reps/")}><h3>Reps Hub</h3><p>Share FOA messages with class groups.</p></a><a class="info-card info-card--link" href={withBase("/about/")}><h3>About FOA</h3><p>See what membership and fundraising mean.</p></a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
